FOR THE ERECTION OF MULTIPLE STRUCTURES (BUILDING A-1, A-2, A-3, A-4, AND A-5) WITH MULTIPLE ROOF DECKS ACCESSED BY MULTIPLE INDIVIDUAL ROOF DECK ACCESS STRUCTURES; SIZE AND LOCATION AS SHOWN ON THE PLAN.

