BUILDING A-4, FOR THE ERECTION OF A DETACHED STRUCTURE WITH ROOF DECKS ACCESSED BY FOUR (4) INDIVIDUAL ROOF DECK ACCESS STRUCTURES; FOR USE AS MULTI-FAMILY (EIGHT (8) DWELLING UNITS) HOUSEHOLD LIVING WITH EIGHT (8) ACCESSORY INTERIOR OFF-STREET PARKING SPACES ACCESSED VIA A SHARED DRIVEWAY FROM PARCEL A; 

BUILDING A-5, FOR THE ERECTION OF A DETACHED STRUCTURE WITH ROOF DECKS ACCESSED BY FOUR (4) INDIVIDUAL ROOF DECK ACCESS STRUCTURES; FOR USE AS MULTI-FAMILY (EIGHT (8) DWELLING UNITS) HOUSEHOLD LIVING WITH EIGHT (8) ACCESSORY INTERIOR OFF-STREET PARKING SPACES ACCESSED VIA A SHARED DRIVEWAY FROM PARCEL A.; SIZE AND LOCATION AS SHOWN ON THE PLAN.

